Subject: [PATCH 11/19] tests: Expect the screen names overlaid while the view
 is open

Identify Screens shows the name of each screen for two and a half seconds. A Show Screen
Names item in the View menu should keep the same labels on the screens as long as the view
is open, drop them when it is switched off, and remember the choice.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
